          DIGITAL PRINTERS RECEIVE "PICK OF THE YEAR" AWARD
                     FROM BUYERS LABORATORY INC.


         DEClaser 3500 and PrintServer 17/600 Laser Printers
                 Recognized As Industry Innovations


MAYNARD, Mass., September 20, 1995 -- Digital Equipment Corporation
today announced that the DEClaser 3500 desktop laser printer and the
PrintServer 17/600 network laser printer were honored with the 
printer "Pick of the Year" awards by Buyers Laboratory Inc. (BLI), 
the nation's foremost independent provider of critical evaluations 
of office products and equipment.  To be selected "Pick of the 
Year," a copier, printer or facsimile machine must have demonstrated 
outstanding performance in BLI's extensive tests and proven to be 
the best of the best in its product category.  The winners were 
announced at an awards ceremony during the BTA '95 Convention held 
at the Las Vegas Convention Center earlier this month.

     BLI tested more than 150 office products during 1994/1995 to
determine the outstanding performers and published reports on its
findings.  Thousands of buyers worldwide rely on these awards and 
test reports to make purchasing decisions.

     "Digital's years of technical expertise in the manufacture of
cost-effective, high-quality, open printing solutions enabled us to 
top such industry leaders as Hewlett-Packard, Lexmark and Canon for 
this honor," said Mike Grabel, manager of marketing for Digital's 
Printer Line of Business. "Recognition from Buyer's Laboratory 
reinforces our commitment to providing customers with innovative 
solutions for their output needs."

     The DEClaser 3500 desktop laser printer is the only 12 page-per
minute laser printer offering the ability to send and receive faxes
domestically and internationally directly from the printer.  This 
network capable printer with 600 dpi is targeted at small to 
medium-size workgroups who need to print and fax professional 
looking documents quickly, reliably and affordably.

     The PrintServer 17/600 network laser printer is designed to 
handle simple text to complex documents containing images and 
multi-font text at 17 pages per minute, 600 dpi resolution in print 
volumes up to 70,000 impressions per month.  It is a departmental 
printer with all of the networking capabilities, printer management 
tools, bi-directional communications and paper handling flexibility 
of Digital's PrintServer products, but with the size, footprint and 
price associated with desktop laser printers.

     The DEClaser 3500 and PrintServer 17/600 printers are available
through Digital's worldwide network of reseller and distributor 
partners.  For more information within the U.S. call 1-800-777-4343, 
or your authorized Digital representative.

     Digital Equipment Corporation is the world's leader in open
client/server  solutions from personal computers to integrated 
worldwide information systems.  Digital's Intel and Alpha platforms, 
storage, networking, software and services, together with industry-
focused solutions from business partners, help organizations compete 
and win in today's global marketplace.
